        <h3 class="peg-sample__heading">
          Growth Decomposition: Source of Rs.1,080 Cr Revenue Growth (FY25 to FY30)
        </h3>
        <p class="peg-sample__text">
          This section breaks down the total projected revenue increase (Base Case) into its
          component drivers.
        </p>

        <p class="peg-sample__subheading">
          ARPU Expansion &amp; Tier Migration (~60% / Rs.648 Cr)
        </p>
        <ul class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>Assumed CAGR: 8%</li>
          <li>Base (FY25): Annualized Revenue per Supplier Rs.61K.</li>
          <li>Target (FY30): ~Rs.90K.</li>
          <li>
            Rationale: Top 10% of customers contribute ~47% of revenue. Growth relies on
            migrating Silver users to Gold/Platinum. Pricing power remains intact in the top
            tier despite churn at the bottom.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="peg-sample__subheading">Net New Supplier Volume (~20% / Rs.216 Cr)</p>
        <ul class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>Assumed CAGR: 3%</li>
          <li>Base (FY25): 217K Paying Suppliers.</li>
          <li>Target (FY30): ~255K Paying Suppliers.</li>
          <li>
            Rationale: Q2 FY26 Net adds were only ~2.8K (normalized). High churn in the 'Silver'
            monthly bucket severely caps volume growth. Est assumes modest recovery but no
            return to pre-2022 volume velocity.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="peg-sample__subheading">
          Accounting Software (Busy Infotech) (~15% / Rs.162 Cr)
        </p>
        <ul class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>Assumed CAGR: 22%</li>
          <li>Base (FY25): ~Rs.66 Cr Rev (Busy).</li>
          <li>Target (FY30): ~Rs.228 Cr.</li>
          <li>
            Rationale: Busy Q2 FY26 billing grew 57% (normalized). This segment is growing
            faster than core B2B but on a smaller base.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="peg-sample__subheading">Other Income/Adjacencies (~5% / Rs.54 Cr)</p>
        <ul class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>Assumed CAGR: 10%</li>
