        <h3 class="peg-sample__heading">Scenario Triggers</h3>

        <p class="peg-sample__subheading">
          Bear Case (FY30 Revenue Rs.2,050 Cr, 25-30% Prob):
        </p>
        <ul class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>
            Trigger 1: Standalone Collections growth drops below 5% for two consecutive quarters
            (indicating pricing power exhaustion).
          </li>
          <li>
            Trigger 2: Net Paying Supplier additions turn negative again (as they did in Q3
            FY25), shrinking the base to &lt;210K.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="peg-sample__subheading">
          Bull Case (FY30 Revenue Rs.3,360 Cr, 15-20% Prob):
        </p>
        <ul class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>
            Trigger 1: &ldquo;Busy Infotech&rdquo; billing growth accelerates &gt;30%
            sustainably, becoming a material revenue pillar (&gt;10% of consol revenue).
          </li>
          <li>
            Trigger 2: Silver tier churn reduces significantly due to product interventions,
            returning net supplier additions to &gt;6K/quarter.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

