        <h3 class="peg-sample__heading">Analyst Watchlist</h3>
        <ol class="peg-sample__list">
          <li>
            <strong>Standalone Customer Collections (Q3/Q4 FY26):</strong> Must exceed 12% YoY
            growth. Current 8% growth (Q2 FY26) is a flashing yellow light for future revenue.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Net Paying Supplier Additions:</strong> Watch if this metric stabilizes above
            4,000/quarter. The Q3 FY25 dip (-3.5K) and Q2 FY26 recovery (+2.8K normalized) show
            volatility.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Busy Infotech Billing:</strong> Monitor the &ldquo;normalized&rdquo; growth
            post-channel partner payout restructuring. If it sustains &gt;40%, this could re-rate
            the multiple.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Unique Business Enquiries:</strong> Growth here (12% in Q2 FY26) is healthy.
            If this decouples from supplier growth, it indicates a monetization failure, not a
            traffic failure.
          </li>
        </ol>
